==Teams and seeding==
The 36 teams were divided into four pots of nine teams each, with the Champions League title holders automatically placed as the top seed of pot 1. All remaining teams were allocated to pots based on their 2026 [[UEFA coefficient#Men's club coefficient|UEFA club coefficients]].<ref name="club coefficients">{{cite web |url=https://www.uefa.com/nationalassociations/uefarankings/club/?year=2026 |title=Club coefficients |publisher=[[UEFA]] |date=30 May 2026 |access-date=28 July 2026}}</ref> The participants include:
* 29 teams which entered at this stage
* 7 winners of the [[2026–27 UEFA Champions League qualifying#Play-off round|play-off round]] (5 from the [[2026–27 UEFA Champions League qualifying#Champions Path|Champions Path]], 2 from the [[2026–27 UEFA Champions League qualifying#League Path|League Path]])

