==Draw==
The draw for the league phase pairings was held at the [[Grimaldi Forum]] in [[Monaco]] on 27 August 2026, with [[Thierry Henry]], the [[UEFA President's Award|UEFA President's Awardee]], and [[David Villa]] as drawing guests.<ref>{{cite web|url=https://www.uefa.com/uefachampionsleague/news/02a8-216cd740d41f-fd3b45ac4a0f-1000--champions-league-league-phase-draw-all-36-teams-learn-their/|title=Champions League league phase draw: All 36 teams learn their opponents|publisher=Union of European Football Associations|date=27 August 2026|access-date=27 August 2026|archive-date=27 August 2026|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20260827175529/https://www.uefa.com/uefachampionsleague/news/02a8-216cd740d41f-fd3b45ac4a0f-1000--champions-league-league-phase-draw-all-36-teams-learn-their/|url-status=live}}</ref>

